SY_TALK("wd5NI9dSK9Q",[[22,["First Public Program","Melbourne, Australia"]],[191,["11 April 1991"]],[1547,["Please be seated."]],[1556,["I think I’ll stand up and speak, would be","better now."]],[1629,["I bow to all the seekers of truth."]],[1641,["At the very outset we have to know that truth","is what it is."]],[1649,["We cannot conceptualize it, we cannot change","it, we cannot buy it, and also unfortunately"]],[1664,["at this human level we cannot know it."]],[1666,["The truth is that you are not this body, this","mind, this intellect, this ego, these conditionings,"]],[1689,["but you are the pure spirit."]],[1696,["The second truth is that there is a all-pervading","Power of divine love, which is very subtle"]],[1710,["and which works out all the living work."]],[1714,["You see all these beautiful flowers here,","and we take them for granted."]],[1720,["We never even think from where have they come,","how have they come, from a one little seed"]],[1725,["how – and so many varieties, so many types","– how they have been created and how they"]],[1737,["grow, and how a flower becomes a fruit."]],[1743,["Look at ourselves; look at our eyes."]],[1746,["It’s one of the greatest cameras you could","think of."]],[1749,["Look at every machinery that is within us,","how it is working beautifully there."]],[1756,["But we do not think about it; we take it for","granted."]],[1762,["All this living work is done by this all-pervading","Power of divine love."]],[1769,["Now when I say that, you need not accept it","blindfolded."]],[1774,["But I would request you to have a scientific","mind, have a scientific attitude that you"]],[1783,["keep yourself open."]],[1785,["Treat this as a hypothesis, and if it is proved","then you have to accept it as truth, if you"]],[1797,["are honest, because it is not only for individual","emancipation but for the emancipation of the"]],[1809,["whole world."]],[1814,["As I have told you that truth cannot be understood","or felt at this human level because we are"]],[1830,["mental, at the most, if not emotional being,","or we are mixture of both."]],[1837,["We are a bundle of conditionings and egos","and everything, but we are not our selves."]],[1843,["When we say “my ego”, “my intelligence”,","“my body” – but where is this “my”?"]],[1850,["From where does this word “my” comes?"]],[1854,["This is what is the spirit within us."]],[1856,["You have been already explained about a mechanism","we have here … and you have been already"]],[1872,["told this kind of a mechanism exists within","us."]],[1882,["(If you remove this one would be better, I","think.)"]],[1887,["Now this mechanism does exist within us, and","is for your last breakthrough in your evolutionary"]],[1898,["process."]],[1899,["You have become from amoeba to a human state,","but we have not yet known the absolute truth."]],[1908,["We have not yet known the absolute knowledge."]],[1916,["[Microphone falls down.]"]],[1921,["All right, now can you see that?"]],[1934,["It’s just for your seeing we are managing","something!"]],[1944,["It’s all right."]],[1946,["But this is all within yourself, is all within","yourself which is not going to fall out!"]],[1955,["So, we have this mechanism, as I told you,","for your last breakthrough."]],[1972,["If we had known the absolute truth and if","we had the absolute knowledge, there would"]],[1978,["have been no quarrelling, no different “isms”;","there would have been no wars."]],[1989,["But because we haven’t got that, we are","separated by ignorance, and everybody thinks"]],[1997,["“I’m right."]],[1999,["Whatever I am doing is the correct thing and","whatever I am thinking is the correct thing.”"]],[2006,["But there is no way to judge whether it is","correct or not."]],[2011,["Like when you say it’s a one meter long,","then we have a meter, as you know, in the"]],[2018,["Museum of Paris which is kept as one meter","all the time."]],[2027,["But that, unless and until you discover we","are living in a relative world without any"]],[2036,["absolute relativity."]],[2037,["That’s why there is chaos; that’s why","there are problems."]],[2044,["Most of the problems if you see are created","by human beings."]],[2054,["These problems, if you just try to locate,","are just based because we haven’t found"]],[2062,["out the absolute knowledge."]],[2064,["For example, if this place is completely dark","and you can’t see anyone and if you start"]],[2070,["all running, you’ll hit someone, somebody","will fall down, somebody will be beaten up,"]],[2077,["somebody might get hurt because there is darkness,","there is confusion."]],[2085,["These are the days of the greatest confusion","that we are born in, and it’s promised that"]],[2091,["in those days of confusion only you are going","to find out the truth."]],[2095,["That’s why there is a category of people,","as William Blake has said, are the men of"]],[2102,["God who will find themselves and they will","make others the men of God."]],[2110,["The time has come for you all to have your","Self-realization, your self-knowledge."]],[2118,["As a result of that you develop a new awareness."]],[2123,["You develop – again I say it’s a question","of becoming; it is not certifying – you"]],[2131,["develop a new awareness on your central nervous","system, which we call as “collective consciousness.”"]],[2139,["Is described by Jung very clearly."]],[2143,["This is where you can feel your centers on","your fingertips, and you can feel the centers"]],[2153,["of other people on your fingertips."]],[2156,["Now only thing you have to do is to know what","do they denote – this decoding has been"]],[2163,["done already – and how to correct them."]],[2168,["So, to correct your being physically, mentally,","emotionally and also spiritually, you have"]],[2176,["to enter inside your being – which you cannot."]],[2179,["For example, you are paying attention to Me,","but if I say “pay attention to yourself”"]],[2186,["you cannot."]],[2187,["You cannot pay attention to yourself inside."]],[2190,["So something has to happen, and this something","is the awakening of this residual power which"]],[2196,["we call as “kundalini.”"]],[2198,["It’s a Sanskrit word: “kundal” means","“the coils” and is there in three-and-a-half"]],[2206,["coils, this energy is settled down."]],[2210,["If this energy is awakened, just like a primule","in a seed – it’s a living process – just"]],[2219,["like a seed sprouts, this kundalini gets awakened,","passes through six centers, pierces through"]],[2228,["the last one, and you yourself feel the cool","breeze coming out of your head."]],[2234,["And then for the first time you start feeling","this cool breeze – it’s not very cool,"]],[2240,["it’s very pleasantly cool – which is the","all-pervading Power of divine love."]],[2248,["With this you become like a divine computer."]],[2254,["You can feel the centers which are in trouble","within yourself."]],[2261,["You can feel the centers of people around."]],[2266,["You can feel the centers of people who are","far away, also the centers of people who are"]],[2271,["dead and gone."]],[2273,["That’s how you can know who was a realized","soul who came on this Earth, and who was a"]],[2278,["nasty fellow and who was a devil."]],[2283,["Otherwise there is no way of making out."]],[2286,["For example, from India people get out of","the jail, immediately they wear these saffron-colored"]],[2292,["clothes and are in Australia: they become","big gurus."]],[2298,["And Australians had lot of money, and they","have really fed them with that."]],[2303,["So many of them are coming down."]],[2306,["But not so many, because so many are exposed","also, so many are in jail, so many have died."]],[2313,["But still, they can say that “the world","is coming to an end, and you must do this."]],[2317,["This is happening, and you must do that”;","and just frighten you."]],[2321,["And you think, “Oh, otherwise, you see,","how can they tell lies?”"]],[2325,["But they are thieves!"]],[2327,["They are coming from the jail direct – you","find out their bona fides: from what kind"]],[2333,["of families they come, what sort of education","they have had?"]],[2338,["But blindfolded, people go to them and get","infected by them."]],[2343,["Mostly they are mesmerizers and they spoil","your chances of your ascent."]],[2348,["Not only that: they can give you some diseases,","they can give you some sort of a brain – you"]],[2354,["might have an effect of your taking a drug."]],[2357,["Anything can they do, I don’t know to what","extent they can go; because so many have come"]],[2361,["to Me, and I am really now fed up the way","people are still running after them, paying"]],[2367,["them money."]],[2368,["It’s something like you see some people","coming out of the pub and falling down on"]],[2372,["the street, and others try to push their way","inside to get again the same way."]],[2380,["But in spirituality you have to know that","you cannot pay."]],[2384,["It’s a living process of living energy;","it’s a living process."]],[2390,["(Will you take photographs afterwards?"]],[2395,["All right?)"]],[2398,["So the second thing that should happen to","you as a result of Self-realization, that"]],[2405,["you get empowered yourself."]],[2409,["You yourself can give realizations to others."]],[2412,["You can find out about another person, you","can give them realization, you can cure them."]],[2420,["You can help them in every way possible."]],[2423,["It’s like one enlightened light can enlighten","another light."]],[2429,["You are all ready for it, absolutely ready","to get enlightened."]],[2433,["I don’t have to do much, you will see that","– how easily you all can get your realization."]],[2440,["It has to be easy, it has to be sahaj, it","has to be spontaneous, because the time has"]],[2446,["come."]],[2447,["And also this all-pervading Power has become","extremely active, extremely active, and it"]],[2454,["is working wonders everywhere."]],[2456,["When the kundalini rises on this center, then","you reach a state which we call as thoughtless"]],[2466,["awareness – in Sanskrit it’s called as","“nirvichar samadhi.”"]],[2470,["When you watch something you just watch, you","don’t think."]],[2474,["If you want to think you can think, but you","are not bombarded by thoughts, you are not"]],[2477,["under the control of thoughts."]],[2480,["Then she rises above and pierces through here,","and establishes a connection properly: then"]],[2487,["you get into another kind of a higher awareness","we call as “nirvikalpa samadhi”, which"]],[2492,["is a doubtless awareness, in which you start","raising the kundalini of others, curing others,"]],[2500,["helping others, knowing such a lot of knowledge;","because once this kundalini goes into the"]],[2506,["limbic area, she enlightens these thousand","petals there – that is the thousand nerves."]],[2514,["Many children I’ve seen who have been absolutely","very dull children now are scoring above everybody"]],[2522,["else, getting scholarships."]],[2524,["We have some boys who have done their engineering","or chartered accountancy and all this thing"]],[2533,["in very, very record time; they have records."]],[2536,["They always stand first and they are doing","very well in their education, but despite"]],[2544,["all that they are extremely humble and obedient."]],[2548,["They respect their teachers, they respect","everyone; because the new virtue which has"]],[2554,["come in them is the respect, to respect others,","which we have lost long time back."]],[2561,["The second thing that happens to a person","is this: that you become absolutely free."]],[2568,["Of course, in the beginning also I respect","your freedom."]],[2572,["I cannot force Self-realization on you – you","have to ask for it."]],[2576,["Otherwise, I cannot force it on you."]],[2580,["But when you get your Self-realization you","become really free, in the sense that you"]],[2586,["are able to be free."]],[2590,["Like we think we are free, but we have addictions,","we are slaves to so many things, we cannot"]],[2596,["control ourselves; so we are not free."]],[2599,["But when you become a self-realized person","all such things which dominate us – whether"]],[2605,["it’s addiction, alcoholism, any habit, any","such thing, tempers, or too much interest"]],[2612,["in wrong things – all drops out and you","become really a able person: absolutely you"]],[2622,["have the ability to be enjoying your freedom","and your virtues."]],[2629,["Then it happens that you start seeing everything,","as I told you, and not getting into thoughts."]],[2639,["The human nature is such that whatever you","see, you react."]],[2645,["But after getting Self-realization you do","not react, and your mind is thoughtless."]],[2651,["It’s like a lake which has no ripples on","it, and all that is created around that lake"]],[2662,["is reflected inside."]],[2663,["In the same way when you watch something,","you just watch it."]],[2666,["Now I watch these flowers: I’m just watching,","and all the joy that the Creator has put it"]],[2672,["in it, it doesn’t come to Me as words but","as joy itself, and it starts pouring on Me"]],[2678,["and it soothes Me down."]],[2681,["You become a person without tension, because","tension comes to you through thoughts."]],[2688,["But thoughts are coming from the past or from","the future, and they throng your head and"]],[2692,["give you this tension."]],[2697,["When the kundalini rises she comes in between","two thoughts, so the future and past – the"]],[2705,["kundalini is in the center, that is, in the","present."]],[2709,["So you just stand in the present, and when","you are in the present there is no tension"]],[2714,["in your mind."]],[2716,["These days there’s a big trouble people","are having of tensions, blood pressures and"]],[2722,["all kinds of things, which are absolutely","there because this window has not yet opened"]],[2729,["out."]],[2730,["Once it has opened out everything goes away,","and you are extremely a relaxed person."]],[2734,["You also reduce at least ten years of your","age."]],[2737,["As you know, I am sixty-eight years of age","and I am travelling every third or fourth"]],[2743,["day all over the world."]],[2745,["So you get very dynamic and you get such a","lot of energy within you."]],[2749,["At the same time you are very compassionate,","you are very considerate, and you are extremely"]],[2757,["wise."]],[2758,["In every way you are helped: you are helped","in your business, you are helped in your work,"]],[2764,["you are helped in your relationship with,","in your family, with others, and the whole"]],[2766,["thing becomes like a beautiful drama you are","playing."]],[2770,["I’m telling, all these things sound very","fantastic to you, and should find – because"]],[2775,["you might say “we have never seen such angels","before.”"]],[2779,["But there is a chance for all of you to become","that."]],[2782,["Supposing you take a television into a remote","village of India where they have never seen"]],[2789,["a television, and tell them that “you can","see pictures from all over the world inside"]],[2794,["this.”"]],[2795,["They’ll say, “What, this box?"]],[2796,["Useless thing – how can it be?”"]],[2798,["But when you put it to the mains, then they","see the miracles of it."]],[2803,["In the same way when you are put it, you are","put to the mains you start seeing the miracles"]],[2809,["of your being."]],[2810,["Then you understand how glorified you are,","how beautiful you are, and what is the purpose"]],[2816,["of your life."]],[2817,["There’s no end to this knowledge."]],[2819,["For example, in here so many lights I see","here, but to put them on there might be only"]],[2824,["one switch and you can put on all the lights."]],[2830,["But supposing I have to tell you all the history,","how it came and how the electricity came,"]],[2835,["and then how it was brought in Melbourne and","how it was fixed and everything, it’s quite"]],[2841,["boring."]],[2842,["So the best thing is just to put on the light","first."]],[2843,["So I would request you, you’d better have","your Self-realization first and then understand,"]],[2851,["because it’s a very subtle subject and I","don’t know how many thousand lectures I"]],[2855,["have given only in English language."]],[2857,["There are many other languages I speak, but","only in English language I don’t know how"]],[2863,["many lectures I have given, and every time","they say, “Mother, every time You say something"]],[2867,["new.”"]],[2868,["I am giving you thus a introduction to Sahaja","Yoga."]],[2875,["Now, once you get your realization you have","to know it works on collectivity."]],[2881,["It’s not that you go home and say, “All","right, Mother, I am meditating at home.”"]],[2885,["It would be like a nail cut out of the body."]],[2889,["You don’t have to pay for anything, but","you have to give some time for your Self-realization"]],[2895,["and you have to come to the collective."]],[2897,["Luckily in Melbourne we have wonderful people","who have achieved great heights in Sahaja"]],[2902,["Yoga."]],[2903,["They are extremely humble, they are extremely","beautiful people, and I’m sure they’ll"]],[2908,["help you to achieve the same heights as they","have achieved."]],[2912,["This is what we have to get."]],[2914,["We have to emancipate the human beings to","solve all our problems, to enter into the"]],[2920,["Kingdom of God."]],[2921,["This has been promised, and this promise has","to be fulfilled."]],[2925,["Of course, before I go ahead with the process","of Self-realization which will take ten minutes"]],[2932,["only, I would request you to ask Me questions."]],[2936,["But ask relevant questions, questions which","show your curiosity to get your realization,"]],[2944,["because I’m not here for any votes, nor","am I here for any money."]],[2950,["I am here to give you your own key of your","own treasures."]],[2954,["So accordingly, please ask Me questions."]],[2962,["I’ll be very thankful to you."]],[2971,["May God bless you."]],[2977,["[Question: He says he thinks he is reaching","that stage, but could You tell him the symptoms?]"]],[3002,["Yes."]],[3003,["We’ll tell him."]],[3007,["You see, first what happens, that you start","feeling the cool breeze out of your head."]],[3015,["Sometimes you might get hot also, hot breeze","coming out; then you start feeling the cool"]],[3022,["breeze all around it."]],[3027,["Then you become aware of it and you work it","out."]],[3033,["Then you give realizations to others."]],[3037,["All these things happen, and you become extremely","peaceful, loving, affectionate, and a righteous"]],[3042,["person – you become."]],[3043,["It’s not like following any religion as","such, because when we follow a religion we"]],[3050,["can do, we can commit any mistakes; any sins","we can commit."]],[3053,["But Sahaja Yoga is such that religion is born","within you – like here, as we have got eight"]],[3059,["valencies within us, ten valencies within","us, and these ten valencies are in this green"]],[3065,["part: when they’re awakened, you become","religious."]],[3067,["You become."]],[3068,["You are not to be told, you just become."]],[3071,["I don’t have to tell you “don’t do this”","– I never say that."]],[3074,["It just happens, because you see in the light","what is right and what is wrong."]],[3084,["[Question: What is God, for You, and is God","a separate entity?]"]],[3105,["Ya, He is."]],[3106,["He is, and God for Me is the one who is witnessing","everything."]],[3108,["But He has His Power which is the Primordial","Mother, which is the Holy Ghost, which is"]],[3115,["reflected within you as the kundalini, and","God is reflected within you as the spirit"]],[3123,["in your heart."]],[3124,["At this point they meet, and that’s how","you get your Self-realization."]],[3127,["But such a wide subject it is, so you have","to have more patience for such a wider subject."]],[3136,["[Question: Will there ever come a time when","the negative force in society will cease to"]],[3164,["exist?]"]],[3166,["Yes, of course, if you help us."]],[3174,["[Question: Which Indian saints or masters","do You acknowledge, or did any of them inspire"]],[3177,["You in Your cause?]"]],[3179,["Yah, all of them were there, and there are","some more but they have all disappeared in"]],[3186,["the Himalayas, because they say that “these","human beings are absolutely dullards and they"]],[3192,["won’t listen to us; You try Your luck!”"]],[3197,["We have so many saints in India who are no","more, who really came down to the masses."]],[3206,["The first one who really ventured to talk","to masses was Gyaneshwara, Saint Gyaneshwara."]],[3213,["About kundalini it was written in so many","Sanskrit books, so many of them, you see,"]],[3219,["but never in a local or a vernacular language."]],[3223,["So Gyaneshwara in the twelfth century first","time talked about it."]],[3228,["He took the permission of his master – because","it was a tradition to have one master and"]],[3233,["one disciple – and he wrote it about it","in his book first of all."]],[3240,["And today the time has come for you to get","en masse realization."]],[3244,["There are so many saints that I really, in","this thing I cannot tell you, but there was"]],[3252,["Ramadasa, there is Nanaka, there is Kabira","– so many of them – Adi Shankaracharya;"]],[3259,["in India, as you ask."]],[3262,["But outside also: William Blake was another","saint."]],[3270,["[Question: He says that T.M."]],[3287,["talks about Self-realization."]],[3298,["What is the difference between their talking","about Self-realization and You talking about"]],[3310,["it?]"]],[3311,["Now they have started."]],[3312,["They never talked about it before, and they","are just talking."]],[3314,["If I have to tell you everything frankly about","T.M., it’s better that you listen to it."]],[3319,["I’m not afraid of them."]],[3322,["I had the head of their siddha – what they","call the “flying academy” – head of"]],[3331,["that, the director, one Mr. Peter Pearce,","his wife, his deputy director and his child,"]],[3337,["all suffering from epilepsy, came to Me."]],[3340,["Luckily My husband was not at home those days,","so I kept them in My house and treated them,"]],[3346,["and got them well."]],[3347,["He’s about to write a book about it."]],[3351,["Now I asked him what do they do."]],[3353,["So he told Me – because he was in it – he","said that they give three mantras, first stage"]],[3359,["they give three mantras, and these three mantras,","they were to pay three thousand pounds."]],[3367,["Now these three mantras, out of them any one","could be yours."]],[3373,["One was “inga”, another was “pinga”,","another was “tinga”."]],[3379,["Now any Indian would laugh at it because they","know there is, these are not Sanskrit words."]],[3384,["“Inga” means the scorpion bite; the “pinga”","means a person when he gets possessed, he"]],[3389,["goes round, is called “pinga” – it is","also in vernacular language, not in Sanskrit"]],[3394,["– and “tinga” means showing like this."]],[3397,["And they paid three thousand – done!"]],[3400,["It’s all marketing."]],[3402,["People are so stupid!"]],[3404,["I mean, I have a disciple who came to Me from","T.M., her sister was in lunatic asylum."]],[3411,["We had to work so hard on her, but now she’s","cured; and this barrister girl, poor thing,"]],[3416,["she suffered so much."]],[3418,["So many people have gone into recluses."]],[3421,["She told Me that she had to go to Switzerland,","pay six thousand pounds for a course of seven"]],[3427,["days."]],[3428,["And the first day they were given – this","is for flying in the air."]],[3433,["Now this is also another stupidity, to go","for flying in the air, half-way through – what"]],[3439,["is the need?"]],[3440,["As it is, today there was such a lot of jam;","you see, if you start flying like this, then"]],[3446,["no car can move!"]],[3449,["What is the need for you to fly at three feet?"]],[3452,["But this is stupidity, and for that stupidity","she paid six thousand pounds."]],[3457,["And she had to go to Switzerland, and she","said, “No arrangements for us, nothing."]],[3461,["We were to live in a big hall, and they asked","us that we have to jump on, what you call"]],[3469,["these foam mattresses,” and she broke her","bottom, and many broke their bottom."]],[3476,["And they were asked, they were asked to give."]],[3480,["And they were given to drink the water that","boiled the potatoes for six days, and the"]],[3487,["seventh day they were given the rind, and","the fifth day the potatoes."]],[3491,["For that they paid six thousand pounds!"]],[3495,["She’s a daughter of a very, very rich man."]],[3500,["But this is what it is, if you have surplus","money there are people to befool you."]],[3505,["There’s a market, it’s all marketing."]],[3508,["Now they are marketing what you call ayurveda."]],[3511,["What is there to market ayurveda?"]],[3514,["You can buy things directly from India; you","don’t need a guru for that."]],[3519,["And most of the ayurveda cannot be practiced","abroad because these are made out of fresh"]],[3524,["leaves."]],[3525,["But if you have to treat yourself with ayurveda","you can go to India."]],[3530,["But Sahaja Yoga is a direct method that you","can cure yourself by, with your kundalini"]],[3536,["awakening."]],[3537,["There are two doctors in Delhi University","who have got their M.D."]],[3544,["on Sahaja Yoga, which proved that Sahaja Yoga","can cure many incurable diseases."]],[3550,["We have cured."]],[3551,["Not that I have cured, but people are cured","through Sahaja Yoga."]],[3558,["Diseases like blood cancer, myelitis, so many","diseases have been cured, and there are so"]],[3563,["many that I really do not know how to even","keep account."]],[3568,["We cannot keep account of them."]],[3570,["So this is what T.M. is."]],[3571,["Whatever they talk, they should prove it."]],[3573,["Have you met any T.M."]],[3575,["fellow who can give realizations to others,","or who can talk like Stephen?"]],[3585,["There is no modus operandi."]],[3586,["There is no modus operandi they can describe","– nothing."]],[3590,["On the contrary, if you are a doctor you can","find them out just like that."]],[3596,["Once in a lecture there was a Sahaja yogi,","who is now head of the Psychology Department"]],[3603,["in Amman – he was there in their meetings","– and they said that when you take the brain"]],[3608,["scan, you see the theta waves."]],[3610,["Immediately he got up, he said, “But you","get it with epilepsy; you get it with epilepsy.”"]],[3616,["And they were shocked."]],[3617,["They just got round him and said, “Doctor,","will you come and have some tea with us?”"]],[3622,["and this."]],[3623,["Then he went there and they were offering","him money and all that."]],[3628,["Is all money business."]],[3629,["If you have intelligence you can understand","it, that it’s all money."]],[3633,["You cannot purchase it."]],[3635,["How much money did you give to Christ?"]],[3637,["How much money did you give to Krishna or","to Rama, or to any one of them?"]],[3645,["Those people whom you can purchase are your","servants; they cannot be your gurus."]],[3654,["[Seeker: I was in Siddha Yoga for seven years","and I have a lot of problems.]"]],[3665,["You will, but I know that, I’ll manage that."]],[3666,["It’s very difficult, but I’ll manage."]],[3667,["I know, with all these yogas you get nothing","but trouble."]],[3669,["I know that."]],[3670,["[Seeker: I tend to get very sleepy and tired,","and meditation makes me even sleepier.]"]],[3675,["I know."]],[3676,["I know that."]],[3678,["I’ll help you, don’t you worry."]],[3681,["I’ll help you, all right?"]],[3684,["Definitely."]],[3685,["I know this is not only your case, it’s","so many."]],[3687,["But in Australia he was so popular."]],[3688,["I don’t know why he was so popular here."]],[3692,["You are supposed to be much more intelligent","than normal people!"]],[3698,["Aren’t you?"]],[3700,["[Question: What are Your views on eating meat,","as opposed to vegetarianism?]"]],[3712,["You see, we, in Sahaja Yoga we treat a person","according to his needs."]],[3723,["Supposing you need proteins, you have to have","proteins."]],[3727,["Supposing you need more carbohydrates, so","you have to have carbohydrates."]],[3730,["It’s a balancing thing."]],[3731,["By eating meat or anything – like you think,","if you save some chickens, can I give them"]],[3738,["realization?"]],[3739,["Simple question."]],[3740,["So we are paying too much attention to all","nonsensical things."]],[3743,["What you have to think, what we are human","beings on top of everything."]],[3748,["Of course, some people don’t have to eat","meat because they have problems; but some"]],[3753,["people have to eat meat because they have","problems."]],[3757,["We have to be logical about everything."]],[3769,["These are all fads, or “isms”."]],[3772,["These are fads: don’t do this, wear this","kind of a dress, go on the street and sing"]],[3779,["“Hare Rama, Hare Krishna” or do another","nonsensical thing, or jump here."]],[3783,["These are all fads and fashions."]],[3786,["The fashion started that you should put a","tin on your head and tie up your hair, bouffant"]],[3792,["or something."]],[3793,["Everybody started doing that."]],[3794,["We must have our individuality, we should","have our personality."]],[3798,["How can we accept anything that comes in the","way?"]],[3801,["And these entrepreneurs are playing with you,","so these gurus also play with you."]],[3806,["We should be alert now – we have already","suffered a lot, haven’t we?"]],[3809,["[Question: What’s Your opinion of Swami","Muktananda?]"]],[3817,["Ah."]],[3819,["Better not ask!"]],[3822,["You know, I have got just now a complete file","on him, from America they have published:"]],[3829,["he’s such a horrible man."]],[3831,["If you want you can read it, but I assure","you will not be able to eat food for at least"]],[3835,["eight days."]],[3838,["He had relations with even thirteen-year-old","girls."]],[3841,["What are you asking about a swami like that?"]],[3845,["Useless fellow!"]],[3847,["[Question: Sai Baba?]"]],[3850,["Another horrible person."]],[3853,["He is giving you diamonds."]],[3854,["Who has given diamonds to others?"]],[3857,["Who wants diamonds?"]],[3858,["From where does he get diamonds?"]],[3861,["You know that very well."]],[3863,["He gets even Swiss watches."]],[3864,["People are so stupid!"]],[3865,["You are talking of spirituality and of God,","not of these mundane things."]],[3873,["If you want you can go in the market and get","a diamond; even if you don’t get, doesn’t"]],[3877,["matter."]],[3878,["Those who have it or have not, nothing wrong","with them."]],[3886,["Look at his, their faces, how they look."]],[3891,["I tell you, how can you be enamored by these","things?"]],[3893,["You always talk of materialism, you talk against","it and then you get enamored by these people"]],[3901,["because they are in America."]],[3903,["When I went there in Boston – can you imagine,","Americans are the best for this – so that"]],[3909,["they asked Me, “How many Rolls-Royces You","have?”"]],[3911,["I said, “I have none.”"]],[3913,["They said, “Then we are not interested in","You.”"]],[3915,["Can you imagine?"]],[3918,["If you are going to impress by these things","you are not going to get to the real thing"]],[3924,["– is definite."]],[3926,["These all things can be bought by money, but","you cannot buy reality with money."]],[3932,["Take it from Me, you cannot."]],[3936,["It has to happen – is a fact."]],[3938,["I am telling you the truth, whether you like","it or not."]],[3939,["[Question: Is there an energy field that is","built up by raising the kundalini en masse,"]],[3942,["and does it spill over into another area?]"]],[3978,["I think, you see, before describing it you’d","better feel it."]],[3982,["All right?"]],[3983,["What’s the use of describing the beautiful","Australia unless and until you visit it?"]],[3988,["Better feel it yourself and then you will","know."]],[3996,["All right?"]],[3998,["Yes?"]],[4000,["[Question from seeker about kundalini raising","giving her headaches.]"]],[4009,["She’s a … With whom did she do this kundalini","awakening?"]],[4020,["Do you know?"]],[4023,["…. Ah, must be somebody like that."]],[4025,["You see, kundalini is your mother, all right,","and she is anxious to give you a second birth."]],[4033,["She works it out herself, beautifully, like","your mother gave you the birth without giving"]],[4037,["you any trouble."]],[4039,["That’s how she works it out."]],[4044,["But if you go to a person who’s not authorized","spiritually, they do all these things."]],[4054,["I have not seen, but – now as they must","have told you that we are working in about"]],[4059,["fifty-four nations, and I must have visited","at least forty-five of them – I have never"]],[4065,["seen anybody suffering because of kundalini","awakening."]],[4068,["On the contrary, feeling very much better."]],[4071,["This is what it is."]],[4074,["You must see first of all when you go to somebody:","what about the disciples, how are they?"]],[4082,["How are they behaving?"]],[4084,["Are they beautiful people?"]],[4087,["Have they achieved anything, have they got","anything?"]],[4091,["And also you must see the life of the so-called","guru."]],[4095,["How does he live?"]],[4096,["Where is his interest?"]],[4100,["But headlong if you fall into something you","are going to suffer, isn’t it?"]],[4105,["Now I’ve been coming to Australia for the","last, how many, from the year ’78 I think,"]],[4112,["’77 or ’78; but I saw all the people were","scattered around these people, not around"]],[4120,["Me."]],[4121,["They all like them, all such kinds."]],[4125,["They wouldn’t come to Me."]],[4129,["Even some people advised Me that “You’d","better charge some money.”"]],[4132,["I said, “How much will you pay?"]],[4134,["Tell Me.”"]],[4136,["This is invaluable – you can’t pay for","it."]],[4138,["[Question: Could You suggest anything that","would help her, now that she’s in that situation,"]],[4141,["please?]"]],[4143,["Help!"]],[4144,["Doesn’t matter, we have people there also."]],[4154,["You give us her address, we’ll find out","for her."]],[4159,["Australia and Iceland’s quite close, isn’t","it!"]],[4161,["But sweet of you to remember her."]],[4163,["[Question: When she meditates she feels the","kundalini rising, but suddenly it drops down"]],[4185,["again."]],[4188,["How does she keep it up?]"]],[4203,["You have been in Sahaja Yoga?"]],[4206,["Did you get your realization through Sahaja","Yoga?"]],[4214,["You see, we do not take responsibility of","people who have been to other places, but"]],[4219,["if you have been in Sahaja Yoga then we can","find out why it is happening."]],[4223,["If you have got your realization through Sahaja","Yoga we know, and we can help you very much"]],[4229,["better."]],[4230,["All right?"]],[4231,["Then it’s our responsibility."]],[4232,["It does happen sometimes because if you have","problems in your brain, or maybe in your body"]],[4239,["there is some disease where the kundalini","wants to help, may be happening, but it can"]],[4244,["be expedited, it can be cleared out."]],[4246,["These are all the problems which can be solved."]],[4249,["You should have patience with yourself, that’s","all."]],[4266,["[Question: Could You explain levels of samadhi","and nirvana?]"]],[4278,["Ah?"]],[4279,["Nirvana?"]],[4280,["…. It’s too early to talk about it, but","first you get your samadhi, all right, step"]],[4285,["by step, step by step."]],[4287,["Nirvana is the same as samadhi is, but in","nirvana state the, it’s the highest that"]],[4296,["you can achieve in spirituality."]],[4298,["All right?"]],[4299,["So it’s step by step we have to move."]],[4302,["We can say it is the beginning of nirvana","and then you have to be working it out and"]],[4315,["you go to nirvana itself, into the complete","state."]],[4319,["But one thing is definite there, that we have","to understand that these words we have read"]],[4328,["from some books and the connotation of them,","it could be very, very wrong, could be very,"]],[4337,["very misunderstood."]],[4339,["So whatever is the reality you should face","it as reality, you should see it as reality:"]],[4348,["not to have any concept about it, because","if you have a concept then may be that it"]],[4354,["might be wrong."]],[4355,["So it’s better to see for yourself."]],[4364,["All right?"]],[4371,["[Question: Is it possible for the kundalini","to be raised prematurely, or does it just"]],[4398,["rise in its own time?]"]],[4409,["Prematurely?"]],[4411,["This is …"]],[4412,["[Question: Is it dangerous?"]],[4413,["– there are lots of written warnings that","kundalini can be dangerous?]"]],[4414,["No, there is no danger at all in kundalini","awakening at all."]],[4415,["As I have told you just now, she’s your","mother."]],[4417,["There’s no danger."]],[4419,["But people must have warnings because they","don’t want you to get realization, perhaps."]],[4423,["One might have warned because they must have","put their hands into some sort of a burning"]],[4427,["fire, thinking it is the kundalini."]],[4431,["So that must be the reason."]],[4432,["So far, we have had thousands and thousands","and thousands of people: nobody has felt anything"]],[4440,["bad."]],[4441,["After all, when you became a human being,","what was the danger in becoming human being"]],[4446,["from a monkey stage?"]],[4447,["Did you feel the cutting of your tail even?"]],[4448,["So after all, you are made a human being for","a purpose, and that purpose is to make you"]],[4461,["the higher being."]],[4463,["How can it be troublesome?"]],[4466,["It is so vitally important."]],[4468,["Why should it be troublesome to you?"]],[4471,["Use logic."]],[4475,["If that is the last breakthrough of your evolution,","it has to work spontaneously and easily."]],[4489,["Now, so there’s one more gentleman but now","this is the last, all right?"]],[4499,["What is the question?"]],[4501,["Can you get up, please?"]],[4503,["We can’t even see you."]],[4506,["Thank you."]],[4508,["[Question: Does Self-realization have to take","place in this life or if you believe in reincarnation,"]],[4519,["does it take place over a longer period?]"]],[4525,["Some people are realized in last life, I know."]],[4528,["They are born as realized souls also, I know."]],[4531,["But I know one thing, that they don’t know","all about it – partly they know."]],[4537,["They have to know all about it."]],[4539,["They have to know all about their powers."]],[4542,["They have to know how to raise the kundalini."]],[4546,["They have to know what is missing in their","realization."]],[4550,["All that they have to know."]],[4557,["All right."]],[4559,["So now, very simple thing we have to do, raise","…. As you know, we have to use the force"]],[4566,["of the Mother Earth very much."]],[4569,["For that we have to take out our shoes for","a very short time."]],[4576,["Those who are sitting on the ground just have","to take out shoes, that’s all, and sit comfortably."]],[4588,["We have the left and the right, two sides,","left and right sympathetic nervous system."]],[4613,["The left caters to our emotional side, and","the right to our physical and our mental side."]],[4626,["So we put both our feet apart from each other","– but those who are sitting on the ground"]],[4632,["are all right, no problem – those who are","not sitting on the ground."]],[4635,["They can sit comfortably there, just folded."]],[4638,["Just sit whichever way you like, folded is","better."]],[4643,["Be comfortable is the point."]],[4649,["Before we start anything else, there are two","conditions which you have to fulfill."]],[4656,["The first one is that you have to know that","you are a human being, and you have to be"]],[4669,["confident that you will get your realization","and that it is your right to get your Self-realization."]],[4683,["You are not to feel guilty about whatever","has happened in the past, because the divine"]],[4693,["love is the ocean of forgiveness, and whatever","mistakes you might have committed can be easily"]],[4706,["dissolved by that ocean of forgiveness."]],[4711,["You must have faith in the power of that ocean."]],[4714,["After all, you are a human being, you are","not God, and if you have done any mistakes"]],[4720,["it’s all right."]],[4722,["So don’t feel guilty, don’t condemn yourselves."]],[4725,["Those who have told you “you are sinners,”","you should know they must be the greatest"]],[4729,["sinners to say that."]],[4730,["Nobody has business to say that to anyone."]],[4733,["So please have full confidence in yourself,","and not to feel guilty."]],[4738,["When you feel guilty, then this center here","on the back side there catches on, on the"]],[4743,["left side, and this gives you horrible diseases","like angina, lethargic organs and also spondylitis."]],[4759,["So why to feel guilty for nothing at all?"]],[4761,["If you think you have done mistakes, forget","it just now."]],[4768,["Second condition is that you have to forgive","everyone in general."]],[4776,["You don’t have to think about people whom","you want to forgive."]],[4781,["Whether you forgive or don’t forgive, you","don’t do anything."]],[4786,["Again, logically you don’t do anything – it’s","just a myth; but if you don’t forgive then"]],[4793,["you play into wrong hands, in the sense those","who wanted to torture you or trouble you,"]],[4798,["they are quite happy, but you are suffering","mentally."]],[4805,["So the best thing is to forgive everyone in","general, not even thinking about any individual"]],[4814,["whatsoever."]],[4815,["This is a very, very important condition."]],[4819,["Every time I have seen everywhere that people","just don’t forgive, and I have to work hard"]],[4827,["on them."]],[4828,["So best is, to make My situation better and","to make the whole thing work out faster, please,"]],[4838,["for My sake forgive everyone, everyone."]],[4843,["These are the two conditions."]],[4849,["That’s all."]],[4854,["(… You know, I don’t need that now."]],[4865,["Too … )"]],[4867,["Now please put your left hand towards Me,","and right hand on your heart."]],[4882,["The spirit is residing in your heart."]],[4891,["Left hand on your lap, just on your lap please,","comfortably."]],[4904,["Now."]],[4907,["Now we are working only on the left-hand side","with right hand, because right hand is for"]],[4916,["action and left hand is for desire."]],[4919,["So when you put the left hand towards Me,","you are desiring to have your Self-realization;"]],[4926,["and with the right hand you are nourishing","your centers, yourself raising your own kundalini."]],[4932,["Now take down your right hand in the upper","portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side."]],[4943,["This is the center which all the prophets","have created for us, all the great masters"]],[4954,["have created for our mastery: mastery over","the divine work, divine laws."]],[4967,["Now we take down our hand in the lower portion","of our abdomen on the left-hand side."]],[4977,["This is the center of pure knowledge."]],[4981,["This knowledge manifests on your central nervous","system."]],[4989,["This is what is called is “bodh” from","where the word “Buddha” has come, or “Ved”"]],[4993,["from the word “vida” – meaning “feeling","on your central nervous system.”"]],[4999,["As the Gnostic: “gn” means “to know.”"]],[5001,["“Know” doesn’t mean mentally, but to","know on your central nervous system."]],[5007,["That’s the pure knowledge."]],[5013,["Now you raise your right hand in the upper","portion of your abdomen and press it hard,"]],[5019,["on the left-hand side."]],[5023,["Again you take your hand onto your heart."]],[5037,["Now please put your right hand in the corner","of your neck and your shoulder, and turn your"]],[5046,["head to your right."]],[5050,["This is the center I’ve told you already","is in trouble when you feel guilty."]],[5063,["Now please take your right hand on to your","forehead across, and put down your head as"]],[5076,["far as possible."]],[5081,["This is the center where you have to forgive","everyone in general."]],[5092,["Now take back this right hand on the back","side of your head, and push back your head."]],[5097,["Push back your head as far as possible."]],[5103,["Here, without feeling guilty, without counting","your mistakes, you have to say, “Oh divine"]],[5112,["Power, please forgive me if I have done anything","wrong, knowingly or unknowingly.”"]],[5121,["That I’ll tell you later on; just now I’m","telling you the position."]],[5125,["Now stretch your palm fully."]],[5129,["Put the center of your palm on top of the","fontanel bone area here."]],[5140,["And now press it hard."]],[5142,["Press down your head."]],[5146,["Press it hard, push back your fingers and","start moving your scalp with the pressure,"]],[5161,["seven times clockwise."]],[5162,["This is important."]],[5163,["Push back your fingers."]],[5164,["Put down your head fully and now go on moving","your scalp seven times clockwise, very slowly."]],[5192,["Now take down your hands."]],[5202,["Now you have to close your eyes."]],[5208,["Before that you can take out your spectacles,","because you are not to open your eyes till"]],[5214,["I tell you; this might help your eyesight."]],[5219,["Now please remember to put your feet on, away","from each other a little bit."]],[5235,["If there’s anything tight on your neck or","on your waist, you can loosen it a little"]],[5247,["bit."]],[5248,["Now put your right hand on your heart."]],[5262,["Here you ask Me a very fundamental question","– you can call Me “Shri Mataji” or “Mother”,"]],[5273,["whatever you like – “Mother, am I the","spirit?"]],[5277,["Mother, am I the spirit?”"]],[5280,["Ask this in your heart three times."]],[5293,["If you are the spirit then you become your","own master, because in the light of the spirit"]],[5304,["you see everything clearly."]],[5309,["So now please take your hand in the upper","portion of your abdomen on the left-hand side,"]],[5316,["press it hard."]],[5323,["Here you have to say, again a question you","have to ask Me, “Mother, am I my own master?”"]],[5335,["Ask this question three times, “Mother,","am I my own master?”"]],[5349,["Three times, in your heart."]],[5376,["As I told you, I respect your freedom and","I cannot force pure knowledge on you, so you"]],[5384,["have to ask for it."]],[5386,["Take your right hand in the lower portion","of your abdomen on the left-hand side and"]],[5397,["here you say six times, because this center","has got six petals, “Mother, please give"]],[5408,["me self-knowledge” – or you can say “pure","knowledge” – “Mother, please give me"]],[5416,["pure knowledge.”"]],[5419,["Say it six times."]],[5447,["Now, raise your right hand in the upper portion","of your abdomen on the left-hand side."]],[5480,["As you have asked for pure knowledge, your","kundalini has started moving upward, so we"]],[5487,["have to nourish these upper centers with self-confidence."]],[5494,["So here you say ten times, “Mother, I am","my own master.”"]],[5507,["Say it with full self-confidence, ten times,","“Mother, I am my own master.”"]],[5522,["I have already told you that the most important","truth about is that you are not this body,"]],[5540,["not mind, not your conditionings, your ego,","but you are pure spirit."]],[5547,["So now raise your right hand on your heart","and say here with full confidence, twelve"]],[5560,["times, “Mother, I am the spirit.”"]],[5565,["Please say it twelve times."]],[5590,["The divine Power is the ocean of knowledge,","is the ocean of love, joy and bliss, but above"]],[5604,["all it is the ocean of forgiveness."]],[5608,["So whatever mistakes you have committed can","be easily dissolved by the power of this ocean"]],[5614,["of forgiveness."]],[5616,["So please forgive yourself and raise your","right hand in the corner of your neck and"]],[5620,["your shoulder, and turn your head to your","right."]],[5629,["Here with full confidence say sixteen times,","“Mother, I am not guilty at all.”"]],[5642,["Please say that, “Mother, I am not guilty","at all.”"]],[5664,["I have already told you, whether you forgive","or don’t forgive you don’t do anything,"]],[5671,["but if you don’t forgive then you play into","wrong hands."]],[5675,["It’s a myth to know that you are not forgiving","someone."]],[5681,["It’s a myth."]],[5684,["So please raise your right hand on your forehead","across, and please put down your head as far"]],[5695,["as possible."]],[5699,["And here with full confidence you have to","say from your heart – not how many times,"]],[5706,["from your heart – please say, it is very","important, “Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[5712,["Don’t say “I try” – just saying it,","with full confidence, “Mother, I forgive"]],[5722,["everyone in general.”"]],[5732,["Now, take back your hand on the back side","of your head."]],[5745,["Push back your head as far as possible."]],[5751,["Here we have to say, without feeling guilty,","without counting your mistakes; just for your"]],[5766,["satisfaction, from your heart, not how many","times, “Oh divine Power, if I have done"]],[5774,["any mistakes knowingly or unknowingly, please","forgive me.”"]],[5806,["Now stretch your right hand."]],[5810,["Put the center of your palm on the fontanel","bone area which was a soft bone in your childhood."]],[5822,["Now put down your head as far as possible,","put down."]],[5826,["Push back your fingers."]],[5828,["Here again I respect your freedom."]],[5837,["I cannot force Self-realization on you – you","have to ask for it."]],[5842,["So now push back your fingers with the pressure;","move your scalp seven times clockwise, saying"]],[5852,["seven times, “Mother, please give me Self-realization.”"]],[5865,["[Shri Mataji blows into the microphone seven","times.]"]],[5899,["Now please take down your hand."]],[5917,["(If you can close the air-conditioning, they","would feel it better.)"]],[5923,["Now please put, open your eyes and put both","the hands towards Me like this, like this."]],[5940,["Now, put your right hand like this, and don’t","think – you can manage, now you don’t"]],[5949,["think."]],[5950,["Put the right hand and put down your head,","and see with the left hand if there is a cool"]],[5957,["breeze – can you get up and show them? – if","there’s a cool breeze coming out of your"]],[5962,["fontanel bone area."]],[5963,["Now, please put the left hand away from your","head, not on top – away, not very far; some"]],[5972,["people get it far also – but just try to","feel if there’s a cool breeze coming out"]],[5978,["of your head."]],[5984,["Now please put your left hand towards Me like","this, like this."]],[5992,["And now put down your head, and now see for","yourself if there’s a cool breeze coming"]],[6004,["out of your head."]],[6006,["(There is so much of cool breeze.)"]],[6010,["Now feel it with the right hand."]],[6028,["Right hand towards Me and left hand: you see","it clearly, if there’s a cool breeze coming"]],[6032,["out of your head, the fontanel bone area."]],[6035,["You can move your hand a little bit up and","down and see for yourself on sideways."]],[6041,["Now, raise both your hands towards the sky."]],[6047,["Push back your head and ask a question, “Mother,","is this the cool breeze of the Holy Ghost?”"]],[6056,["or ask, “Mother is this the all-pervading","Power of divine love?” or “Mother, is"]],[6065,["this the Paramachaitanya?”"]],[6066,["Ask any one of these questions three times,","raising your hands."]],[6075,["Put down your hands, please."]],[6082,["So much of breeze already blowing all over!"]],[6085,["All those … it’s tremendous breeze already","blowing all over."]],[6091,["It’s not air-conditioning, for your information."]],[6096,["Now those who have felt the cool breeze out","of their fontanel bone area or on their hands"]],[6103,["or fingertips, please raise both your hands."]],[6115,["May God bless you."]],[6121,["So many of you have felt it now."]],[6124,["Some of you have not felt, doesn’t matter."]],[6126,["Tomorrow again we have a program, and I’ll","explain to you more about the nature of spirit"]],[6135,["and the nature of these centers."]],[6138,["Please inform your friends, everyone, to come,","and tomorrow hopefully, I will meet all of"]],[6144,["you one by one."]],[6147,["Also those who have problems should write","them on a piece of paper and their address,"]],[6154,["and we’ll try to contact them and help them","as far as possible."]],[6162,["Thank you very much."]],[6165,["Those who have not felt can come on this side","and the Sahaja yogis can work it out in five"]],[6174,["minutes, those who have not felt."]],[6176,["Because you did not forgive; I know you have","not forgiven."]],[6179,["If you had forgiven you would have felt it."]],[6181,["Come along, this side."]],[6182,["Just five minutes and they’ll give you realization."]],[6187,["You felt it?"]],[6188,["Ha, good."]],[6189,["Your problems will be solved now, it’s good."]],[6193,["You felt it?"]],[6197,["…. Which hand you felt?"]],[6202,["Left you felt, not the right?"]],[6211,["…. Doesn’t matter."]],[6215,["We’ll work it out."]],[6223,["It’s good."]],[6227,["Surprising!"]],[6229,["…. First of all, see on their heads are","you feeling it or not; just see it."]],[6233,["They might be saying they are not feeling","it because of Vishuddhi."]],[6240,["…. Yes, yes, do."]],[6242,["[Seeker asks about her chronic low energy,","and the Hatha Yoga she has been doing.]"]],[6264,["You know, you see this modern Hatha Yoga is","most unscientific."]],[6276,["It is just done like all the medicines you","take from the medicine box, without knowing"]],[6281,["what you need really."]],[6282,["So you give up that and come to Sahaja Yoga","and know what’s wrong with you, and fill"]],[6288,["yourself with energy, all right?"]],[6290,["Is all nonsense."]],[6291,["It’s all nonsense."]],[6292,["It has given heart attacks to people, heart","attacks."]],[6295,["It’s the way they go about it."]],[6297,["We also do a little bit of Hatha Yoga, but","wherever it is necessary; it’s not like"]],[6301,["mad, doing all the time there."]],[6303,["Now you have a catch on this one, you have","a catch on there."]],[6310,["Two centers are very badly caught up."]],[6311,["So you’d better come to Sahaja Yoga, all","right, and fix yourself up, because Hatha"]],[6316,["Yoga nobody reaches God, that’s true."]],[6320,["But this Hatha Yoga is very limited: a wee","bit of it."]],[6322,["You see, Patanjali wrote “Ashtanga Yoga”","out of which this Hatha Yoga that you do is"]],[6329,["one-eighth of one of them."]],[6332,["And that to be is understood with the guidance","of the kundalini: where is the kundalini stopping?"]],[6337,["Whatever center it is stopping, that is the","one you have to look after."]],[6342,["And that is the one you have to do that particular","asana for that particular thing – not all"]],[6347,["of them like that mad."]],[6351,["All right?"]],[6353,["So …. You cannot do it unless and until","you start your kundalini."]],[6357,["Once you start your kundalini, you will know","where the problem is."]],[6361,["It’s like if your car has started then you","will know where is the problem is, isn’t"]],[6367,["it?"]],[6368,["It’s like that."]],[6372,["May God bless you."]],[6378,["So now, how are you?"]],[6385,["Your sister?"]],[6388,["You are all right now?"]],[6394,["She’s in Iceland."]],[6399,["You give her address to us, we’ll contact","her."]],[6406,["All right."]],[6407,["What is she, now?"]],[6417,["Iceland?"]],[6422,["…. What’s the matter with her?"]],[6436,["…. You see, they will tell …. You come","and see Me, and take the photograph .… And"]],[6482,["then you send My photograph, and tell her","to put both her hands towards the photograph"]],[6502,["and both her feet in"]],[6741,["the water with salt every night …. Both","the hands to the photograph, and both the"]],[6956,["feet in the water …. All right?"]],[7004,["But"]],[7536,["first you master this."]],[7563,["You felt the cool breeze?"]],[7591,["[Seeker says he wasn’t sure if it was cool","or not.]"]],[7645,["Better forgive."]],[7655,["You have to forgive …. you don’t forgive."]],[8108,["How can I forgive for you?"]],[8238,["You have to forgive yourself, forgive everyone."]],[8334,["I can’t forgive for you."]],[8363,["[Seeker asks where Shri Mataji lives in India.]"]],[8419,["For practical purposes I live in London."]]]);
